{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15857","headline":"送司空曙之苏州 · 苗发","name":"送司空曙之苏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盘门吴旧地，蝉尽草秋时。\n归国人皆久，移家君独迟。\n广陵经水宿，建邺有僧期。\n若到西霞寺，应看江总碑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苗发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}